WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.840
You’re a new SCP Foundation researcher on
a tour of Site 17, familiarizing yourself

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.040
with the location and its&nbsp;
many anomalous inhabitants.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:13.280
It’s the second-largest Foundation containment
site out there, and it’s also the kind of

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:18.320
job that most junior researchers dream of:
Low-risk humanoid containment, baby.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:22.720
Most of the inhabitants in your sector are
cordial, willing to comply with orders from

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:27.040
staff, and seem - for all intents and purposes
- pretty much human.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:31.440
You pass from door to door, looking through
the viewing hatch of each one.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:36.560
You can’t believe what you’re seeing - it’s
a wonderful who’s who of anomalous humanoids.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:41.520
You see the wise, bearded face of SCP-343,
known to some as God.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:47.120
You see the blue eyes and shining blond hair
of Iris - SCP-105 - looking wistfully into

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.400
a polaroid picture.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.960
You see the tanned, melancholic face of Cain,&nbsp;

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:55.120
SCP-073, as he stares off&nbsp;
into the middle-distance.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:01:00.560
Face after face after face passes, you can
see yourself getting more familiar with each

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.120
one.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.400
Yes, your time here will be-
Wait, was that Hitler!?

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:08.960
You stop and walk back to the door you just
passed, where you can’t help but stop and

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:10.560
stare in disbelief.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.960
Yes, it’s him, it’s got to be him!

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:15.280
You recognize the unpleasant sneer.

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:16.720
The hideous combover.

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:19.360
The silly little toothbrush mustache.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:25.040
The SCP Foundation seems to have Adolf Hitler,
the former leader of the Third Reich in World

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:31.280
War II, in active containment, and his designation
is SCP-2430.

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:35.760
You’ve seen killer toasters and masks that
can take over people’s minds, but you’ve

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:39.120
never seen anything as surreal as this!

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:43.760
You immediately run to your superior, and
ask how and why Hitler is in one of the Site

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:45.520
17 humanoid containment cells.

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:45.920
Your superior chuckles.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:50.720
Buckle in, because we can guarantee it’s
one of the most insane stories you’ve ever

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:51.360
heard…

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:57.920
It’s late April, 1945, and the Soviets are
rampaging through Nazi Germany, destroying

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.520
everything in their path.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:04.720
The German forces have been nearly obliterated,
and Hitler and the rest of his Reich Chancellery

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:08.080
have retreated into a secure bunker beneath
Berlin.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:13.920
There on April 30th, ten days after his 56th
birthday, Hitler died.

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:18.560
This was truly unfortunate for the Soviets,
as they wished to have had the chance to kill

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.080
him themselves.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:23.280
Two days later, Soviet forces stormed the
Führerbunker.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:27.760
It was little more than a formality at that
point, as the news of Hitler’s death had

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:29.040
already gone public.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:34.160
By the time they arrived, all that was left
of Hitler was a pile of mostly burned remains

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:39.600
- a fitting end for someone who had caused
that same cruel fate for so many others.

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:43.760
They collected what was left of Hitler’s
body, and brought it back to the fatherland,

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:46.000
a kind of trophy for their nation.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:51.360
But Hitler dying before Joseph Stalin could
get his hands on him, was not what Stalin

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.160
wanted.

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:57.840
Hitler had not only caused the deaths of millions
of Russians, he had personally betrayed Stalin’s

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:58.640
trust.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:02.960
And when you betray Stalin, bad things happen
to you.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:07.200
Very very bad things.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:13.120
Two years earlier, in 1943, Soviet forces
had raided a camp in Janowska belonging to

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:14.560
the Obskurakorps.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:19.680
Think of them as the Nazi’s own version
of the SCP Foundation, who were hellbent on

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:24.160
gathering anomalous people and artifacts to
increase the power of the Third Reich.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:28.720
They were a far more militant offshoot of
the Thule Society, a group that described

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:31.680
itself as a “Study Group for Germanic Antiquity.”

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:37.120
While this may seem innocent, the Thule Society
were actually a racist cult, closely aligned

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:40.160
with the goals and ideals of the German Nazi
Party.

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:44.960
Many have also speculated that they were heavily
involved in the Occult, and it’s this mysticism

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:48.320
obsessed offshoot that went on to form the
Obskurakorps.

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:53.520
And in their Janowska base, they’d obtained
a hundred pieces of enchanted occult flesh

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:56.880
with human skeletons embedded in each of them.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:00.560
This flesh was believed to originate from
the mythological Sæhrímnir,

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:05.600
the beast hunted and eaten again and again
by the pantheon of Norse gods, having the

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.320
qualities of both a wild boar and a goat.

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:13.440
The flesh can bond to skeletons, and give
them a quality somewhat like immortality:

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:19.040
Any flesh cut from them will regrow, time
and time again, if given a rest period.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:24.160
Now that he had both the flesh of Sæhrímnir
and Hitler’s burnt remains, Stalin had an

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:24.960
idea.

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:30.080
A perfect way to not only bring satisfaction
to the Russian people and the world, but to

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.920
finally exact the true revenge that Hitler
had denied to him.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:38.560
He called it Project Judecca, named after
the very bottom level of Hell, reserved for

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:40.320
betrayers like Judas.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:43.760
A perfect tribute for an old ally turned enemy.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:48.640
He couldn’t kill Hitler before, but if Stalin
was going to get the chance, Hitler needed

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.480
to live again.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:54.560
For years, Stalin’s stop scientists tried
to use arcane methods to resurrect Hitler

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:57.440
by combining his remains with the flesh of
Sæhrímnir.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:02.720
At times, they even came close to creating
a new Hitler, but there was one huge issue:

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:07.920
The creature they created could not feel pain,
and for Stalin’s plans of violent and painful

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:11.760
retribution, the lack of suffering simply
would not do.

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:15.280
They destroyed what they had created, and
went back to the drawing board.

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:20.160
Stalin would stop at nothing to get what he
wanted - even if it meant breaking every law

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:22.080
of nature in the process.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:26.960
In order to make his twisted dream a reality,
Stalin formed an unholy alliance with a group

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:32.160
known as the Uralic flesh-crafters, a Neo-Sarkic
Cult that was a branch of the nightmarish

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.920
religion of Sarkicism.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:39.440
This group essentially worships avatars of
flesh, corruption, and disease, and are behind

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:43.840
some of the most terrifying and disgusting
anomalies out there - including The Flesh

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:46.560
That Hates and The Bone Orchard.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:52.000
True Sarkicists, who show the proper devotion
to their vile deities and know the right rituals

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:56.960
to contact them, are often granted anomalous
powers to spread the Sarkic influence further

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:59.040
across the known dimensions.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:03.280
These powers will usually involve having a
supernatural ability to manipulate the flesh

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:09.040
of themselves and others, allowing them to
enhance their bodies, cheat death, and warp

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:11.360
their enemies beyond repair.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:17.360
They can sometimes even create life, if they’re
a powerful enough acolyte of Sarkicism.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:22.320
And it was because of these powers that Stalin
wanted the Uralic flesh-crafters under his

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:23.120
command.

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:27.520
In exchange for their participation, he would
give them a vast quantity of the flesh of

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:31.840
Sæhrímnir, which they could use for their
own sinister Sarkic purposes.

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:34.960
A deal was struck, and the&nbsp;
true work of resurrecting&nbsp;

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.400
Hitler began.

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:39.120
Stalin was very specific in his requirements.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:44.000
He gave the Uralic flesh-crafters extra bones
to compensate for what had gone missing from

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.600
Hitler’s burnt remains.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:49.760
He also gave them samples of the flesh of
Sæhrímnir to achieve the desired effects

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.400
of a near-immortal tolerance for damage.

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:56.960
However, Stalin demanded that they heighten
this new Hitler’s capacity to experience

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:02.320
pain, so that every suffering inflicted on
him would be three times worse than anyone

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:03.040
else.

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:08.320
And true to their word, the flesh-crafters
got to work, and began creating just such

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.200
a creature.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:13.840
By now it was the early 1950s, and Stalin
was putting the pieces in place for his grand

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:14.800
revenge.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:19.680
Once the new Hitler was finished, he would
hold a new trial for him in the Russian courts,

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:23.040
where he would preside over the sentencing
personally.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.000
Once the new Hitler was done,&nbsp;
the Uralic flesh-crafters&nbsp;

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.640
were rewarded for their participation in Project

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:32.560
Judecca with 4000 kilogram of the flesh of
Sæhrímnir.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:38.080
Stalin now had his very own personal Hitler
chew toy, that he could maim and torture as

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:42.960
much as he pleased, knowing he would always
heal and soon be ready for more.

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:48.080
In their infinite generosity, the flesh-crafters
even taught Stalin a new method of torment

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:52.160
for his old enemy: A process known as the
Rite of Nyúz.

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:56.560
It’s a torture that’s been described by
many as being like the Chinese Lingchi, also

00:07:56.560 --> 00:08:02.160
known as the lingering death, or slow slicing,
but it is probably best known as the death

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.920
by a thousand cuts.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:06.480
The Soviets and the Sarkics parted ways.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:11.200
For the next few years, Stalin took a great
deal of pleasure in visiting Hitler’s cage

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:16.000
now and then to torture him, until Stalin
himself eventually passed away from natural

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:16.800
causes.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:22.480
The GRU-P Division, which is essentially the
Soviet answer to the SCP Foundation, decided

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:26.720
it would be best to do away with the immortal
Hitler clone after Stalin’s death.

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:32.160
He no longer served any purpose, and no matter
how hard they tried, they couldn’t permanently

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:33.440
kill him, either.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:38.720
In the end, they settled on a kind of compromise:
He would be buried alive and forgotten, forced

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:42.400
to live a torturous eternity that he could
never escape.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:47.920
Until, of course, he was dug up and rescued
by none other than members of OBSKURA, a modern

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.560
splinter group of the original Obskurakorps.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:54.960
Like many high profile Nazis who’d escaped
the war, the new Hitler was spirited away

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:58.240
to a safehouse run by sympathizers in Argentina.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:02.720
The ones taking care of him received the following
correspondence from the OBSKURA agents who’d

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:05.040
first dug the new Hitler back up:

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:08.080
“We have managed to rescue the Führer and
bring him to safety.

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.720
But he is effectively dead on the inside.

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:15.360
I blame the Reds for their inhumane treatment
of the Führer, who may have been bewitched

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.880
by the Reds' wunderwaffe.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:20.240
I wish we could mercy kill him, but we've
tried everything.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:21.840
He just won't perish.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:24.960
Don't abandon him; he's too distinct in plain
sight.”

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.440
They didn’t have the new Hitler for long
though.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:32.880
In 1960, efforts to hunt down the remaining
Nazi fugitives increased in intensity.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:37.600
The new Hitler was soon captured by Mossad
Agents searching for Nazis in Buenos Aires,

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:41.600
and then remanded to the containment of the
SCP Foundation when they realized that he

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.760
had a number of anomalous properties.

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:48.720
Such as his incredible regenerative abilities,
as well as the fact that his DNA seems to

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:52.560
be based on that of a wild boar and goat rather
than a human.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:57.120
However, X-Rays conducted by the Foundation
have discovered traces of cyanide still in

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:01.840
his system, as well as traces of lead in his
skull where the bone has regrown over the

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:02.480
bullet.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:08.080
In other words, it was unquestionably the
real Hitler, and he was now in Foundation

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.840
custody forevermore.

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:14.080
It’s such a wild story, even by Foundation
standards, that you can barely summon the

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:17.200
words to respond once your supervisor is finished.

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:21.360
He just stands there with a slight smile,
basking in your amazement.

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:26.560
Before you can even ask again, he confirms
the facts one more time: Yes, it is the real

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:30.320
Hitler, the only functional difference is
that he can’t die and he has a heightened

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:32.400
sense of pain compared to most people.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:36.880
You think on what you’ve just been told
for a moment, and then you have only one question.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:38.240
“Are we allowed to punch him?”

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.280
Your supervisor smiles and says, “Of course.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.160
We all do.”

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:48.880
Now go check out “SCP-1861 - The Crew of
the HMS Wintersheimer” and “SCP-3999 - I

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:53.600
Am At The Center of Everything That Happens
To Me” for more nightmarish SCPs!

